contentText:
All he does is win! Billboard can exclusively announce that Ludacris is joining Chris Stapleton and Cindy Blackman Santana for Monday Night Football &#8216;s signature opening with Phil Collins&#8217; iconic 1981 hit &#8220;In the Air Tonight.&#8221;

